Read the complete perspective and actual definitions/examples, then independently calculate atom economy, product yield, E factor and process mass intensity on consistent boundaries. Extend the comparison with energy, hazard, water, useful function and life-cycle consequences; one mass metric cannot settle every environmental or economic question.

